   "type": "transcript.agent",
   "reply_id": "reply_fix3a",
   "text": "That was the simulation — this is your coach. This is what a good call looks like: you asked for the vendor number, cited the rule, and — most importantly — you didn't just say no, you offered the safe path: hold the invoice and start the verified callback. A caller making a real change has nothing to lose from a callback; a scammer loses everything. That's the tell to teach."
